      "text": "🏃‍♂️ GMR HYD RUN – 10K | TRAFFIC ADVISORY 🚦\n📍 GMR Arena, Shamshabad\n\n📅 03 Jan 2026 | ⏰ 4:00 PM – 9:00 PM\n\nTraffic arrangements & diversions will be in place for the smooth conduct of the GMR HYD Run – 10K.\n\n👉 Route starts & ends at GMR Arena\n👉 ~5000 runners expected\n👉 Runners on extreme left of the road\n👉 Parking only in designated areas\n\n Plan your travel in advance & follow traffic instructions.\n\n Cyberabad Traffic Police\n Safety • Fitness • Smooth Traffic\n\n#GMRHYDRun #HYDRun10K #CyberabadTrafficPolice\n#TrafficAdvisory #Shamshabad #RoadSafety\n#PlanYourTravel #SafeCommute",
